{"4462930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bell Knight", "steam_appid": 4462930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face, nightmarish enemies armed with nothing but your trusty <strong>bell</strong> and unbreakable resolve. <strong>Charge your swing—hold it, feel it build</strong>—until the weight of your strike becomes a bone-shattering force capable of crushing anything in your path. <strong>Every extra second you hold your swing fuels a more devastating blow.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462930/extras/5cebd6a03e00401f85344a8ea601f994.poster.avif?t=1775149724\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462930/extras/5cebd6a03e00401f85344a8ea601f994.webm?t=1775149724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462930/extras/5cebd6a03e00401f85344a8ea601f994.mp4?t=1775149724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dodge with precision. Weave through incoming strikes by inches. Let enemy attacks slice through the space you just occupied. Then retaliate with perfectly timed, punishing counterattacks that turn defense into destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Patience makes you powerful. Timing makes you lethal.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"t